---
/**
 * Files — informational panel. The real Mission OS ships a Dolphin-based
 * file manager; the concept demo shows what makes it different rather than
 * simulating a full filesystem browser.
 */
---
<div class="info-root">
  <p class="info-lead">
    The real Mission OS ships a <em>Dolphin-based file manager</em>, hardened for private workflows.
  </p>

  <dl class="info-list">
    <div class="info-item">
      <dt>Encrypted-container browsing</dt>
      <dd>Mount and browse LUKS2 volumes inline. Unlock happens once per session, not once per file.</dd>
    </div>
    <div class="info-item">
      <dt>Thumbnails disabled by default</dt>
      <dd>Preview generation writes to disk and leaks structure — off unless you opt in per folder.</dd>
    </div>
    <div class="info-item">
      <dt>Per-folder encryption profiles</dt>
      <dd>Different vaults, different keys. No single-key-rules-them-all mistake.</dd>
    </div>
    <div class="info-item">
      <dt>Recent files not indexed</dt>
      <dd>Unless you opt in. Recent lists on most OSes are a privacy leak — Mission OS defaults to off.</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>

  <p class="info-foot">
    Not launchable in the concept demo — this window is informational. Try Installer or Settings for real Mission OS UX.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .info-root { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--sp-5); }
  .info-lead {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .info-lead em { color: var(--purple-bright); font-style: italic; }
  .info-list {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--line);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .info-item {
    background: var(--surface-1);
    padding: var(--sp-4);
  }
  .info-item dt {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-eyebrow);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--purple-bright);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .info-item dd {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: var(--leading-body);
  }
  .info-foot {
    padding: var(--sp-3) var(--sp-4);
    border: 1px dashed var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    color: var(--muted-2);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-eyebrow);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
